The extra AC is given to anything of sufficiently high level, but the
demon lords (and Rodney) are _extremely_ high level.  The bonus AC _is_
capped at a certain amount.

However, it does satisfy a few concerns:  

One -- the demon lords are now actually somewhat nasty.  
Two -- because of 1), you have more incentive to bribe them (as opposed
to vanilla, where you bribe Beez with 2GP to save time, and keep Asmo
around to map the dungeon from the bottom up.)
Three -- This _also_ encourages people to consider using weapons they're
"expert" in, as well as the rings of increase accuracy and gauntlets of
dexterity... rather than simply wishing up the best weapon on the
spreadsheet, regardless of role or alignment.

